  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Transporte Urbano Curitiba</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Urban Transport Curitiba</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE OBJECTIVE OF THE PROGRAM IS TO IMPROVE THE PUBLIC TRANSPORTATION IN THE CITY OF CURITIBA, ESPECIALLY IN LOW-INCOME AREAS, AND INTEGRATE CHANGES WITH URBAN PLANNING BY EXTENDING THE NETWORK OF PUBLIC BUSWAYS, PROVIDING SERVICES NEAR STATIONS, DECREASING CONGESTION IN THE NORTH-SOUTH CORREDOR, AND MAINTAINING INTEGRATED FARES AND THE FINANCIAL VIABILITY OF OPERATION OF THE SYSTEM WITHOUT SIGNIFICANT INCREASES IN FARES OR SUBSIDIES FOR OPERATION.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
